            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>false</code> koşulunda farklı kod çalıştırmak için <code>!condition</code> kullanan başka bir <code>if</code> ifadesi ekleyelim.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" !condition {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"63\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>!condition</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
